{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.wuli.2022a.q10.material.recovered", "text": "阅读材料，根据要求完成教学设计。 材料一《义务教育物理课程标准（2011 年版）》关于“比热容”的内容要求为：“通过实验，了解比热容，尝试用比热容说明简单的自然现象”。 材料二 义务教育九年级的某版本教科书“比热容”一节“比较不同物质吸热的情况”的实验如图所示。材料三 教学对象为义务教育九年级学生，已学过电流的热效应、内能等知识。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中物理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe8423eddc7639bdf5df4a10f891c0d4aca7255d20ddc8b240743c19c5f967a", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2253, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2419, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中物理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 10, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbe8423eddc7639bdf5df4a10f891c0d4aca7255d20ddc8b240743c19c5f967a"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.wuli.2022a.q10"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.wuli.s1.k06", "ntce.chuzhong.wuli.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.wuli.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.306.r005", "ntce.outline.306.r009", "ntce.outline.306.r010", "ntce.outline.306.r011", "ntce.outline.306.r014", "ntce.outline.306.r019"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.wuli.2022a.q10"], "word_count": 166, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "wuli", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中物理》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中物理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbe8423eddc7639bdf5df4a10f891c0d4aca7255d20ddc8b240743c19c5f967a", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2253, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2419, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中物理》题.csv", "role": "question_r